Explanation: The comment "@@@ Size of stack decreases by x in the function" corresponds to the assert statement "Debug.Assert(OLD(s.size) - x >= 0)". Here, s.size is the size of the stack at the beginning of the function, and x is the input value that increases the size of the stack. The assert statement checks if the size of the stack decreases by x or more after the function execution.--------------------
